# Store backends

- Detect the installed official client. Command it. Do not copy Steam/Epic/GOG/Riot trees into Exo.
- Steam install/update/uninstall goes through `ExoLauncher.SteamIpc` (`steamclient64.dll` IPC). Not OCR, not SendInput, not DepotDownloader, not nesting Steam under Exo.
- Epic = Legendary. GOG = gogdl. Riot = RiotClientServices patch API. Xbox/EA/Ubisoft/Battle.net/Amazon/Rockstar = list + launch only until an official agent exists.
- Progress lives in Exo. Store chrome stays hidden. Anti-cheat processes are never killed.
